	quest.4E47E9037FE0220F.quest_desc: ["              Welcome to The Quantum Haunt. This is my first modpack and if its enjoyed i would love to make another. this pack is a mixture of tech/horror. The horror elements in this game aren't overwhelming i wanted to keep it a slightly mellow to focus on the mods and story. Full credit to all the mod creators for creating the mods non of them are mine all i jave done is altered some recipes."]
