	quest.5CD48B44DE81CCA4.quest_desc: ["                   You awake, The world you are in is familiar but something feels off. You can figure it out but you have more pressing matters to deal with. Night approaches and in this world you have many foes. Get the basics and gear up. Good luck!"]
