	quest.5DAD42D78753E8AF.title: "Brass Age"
	quest.5DBEB8B6083DBF13.quest_desc: [
		"Prologue:"
		""
		"         You are stuck. The world feels like you own but for reasons you can quite explain its different. You feel watched, no matter where you go you feel eyes burning in the back of your head. You know you’re not crazy. At night things can get a bit more…… Serious. You can feel a dark presence coming from deep in the planet. Could the Darkness be the reason your trapped here, Could it… have trapped you. On you, you have a quest book, complete quests to progress the story. You need to be rid of the Darkness and free the people of this alternate dimension. Maybe start some side hustles to get you the resources you need. First things first, You need a base of operations. You should probably find somewhere……. Large."
	]
	quest.5DBEB8B6083DBF13.quest_subtitle: "You shouldn't have came....."
